<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hello {!Account.Name},</font></span><div style=""><span style="line-height: 107%;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I hope you're doing well. We are pleased to invite you to
submit a proposal to establish a Centre of Excellence (COE) under the Wadhwani
Innovation Network program. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To ensure clarity and uniformity, please <b>follow the
submission format</b> provided at the end of this email. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We request you to <b>select up to 2 Focus Areas</b> (amongst
Artificial Intelligence, including Generative AI and other advanced AI;
Semiconductor Technology; Quantum Computing/Advanced Computing; Bioengineering
and Healthtech; Biotechnology and Synthetic Biology; Spacetech and Mining Tech)
and then select specific sub-areas (within these Focus Areas) in alignment with
your strengths and our program's goals, for the final proposal submission. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Kindly submit your final proposals by &lt;Proposal
submission date&gt; </b>on our grant management platform<b>&nbsp;</b>by clicking<b>&nbsp;</b><b><i><a href="https://wadhwanifoundation--wfdev.sandbox.my.site.com/WadhwaniOrg">here</a></i>&nbsp;</b>to facilitate timely evaluations and decisions. We're keen to see
your innovative contributions and further our collaborative impact.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">For any questions or clarifications, please </span></font><a href="http://winadmin@wadhwanifoundation.org">winadmin@wadhwanifoundation.org</a><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.
Thank you for your dedication to innovation and our partnership.<o:p></o:p></span></font></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">WIN Management Team<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" width="700" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 6.75pt; margin-right: 6.75pt;">
